  "prompt": "Look only at order lines with 2 or more units. Which categories have more than 9,000 such lines? Use the sales table and its category_name column. Return two columns, in this order: category_name and n_lines, the number of order lines with 2 or more units. Lines with missing units do not count. Return one row per category, and only the categories with more than 9,000 of these lines. Any row order is fine.",
